06\n- Failed job: `plan`, job id 105854709957\n- Failed step: `terraform plan (fail on drift)`\n- Exact error repeated for required inputs: `Error: No value for required variable`\n- Missing variables reported in the failed log include `bedrock_daily_cap_usd`, `bedrock_warn_threshold_usd`, `bedrock_cap_seed_rates`, and `bedrock_cap_unknown_rate_per_1k`.\n- Same signature also occurred in workflow-dispatch run 35418919284 on the same head SHA before the scheduled run.\n\nThis affects main's operational CI signal: Terraform Drift cannot evaluate the live configuration, so it cannot distinguish real drift from an unevaluable plan.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `Terraform Drift` on `main` supplies concrete values for the Bedrock spend-cap variables or gives them safe defaults committed with the Terraform configuration.\n- [ ] A fresh `Terraform Drift` run on `main` reaches a plan verdict instead of failing with `No value for required variable`.\n- [ ] The workflow summary preserves the distinction between real Terraform drift and plan-generation failures.\n\n## Verification\n\nInspect or run a fresh `Terraform Drift` workflow on `main` and confirm the `plan` job no longer fails for missing `bedrock_*` input variables.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"859c-760d-04dd-44a6","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Terraform Drift is red on main because new Bedrock spend-cap variables have no CI values","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["b2dda78a-8214-41de-a516-88a8589fc0d4","d185a229-9b78-4f0e-95f3-54b9faf0873f"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1789882902661376243,"uuid":"93dec459-87f5-466f-af33-5fc7e5bfc426"}